{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misha</strong> is a cute anime girl who\u2019s always by your side to brighten your day. She loves dancing, making funny faces, and trying on new outfits. Help her collect a whole wardrobe of stylish clothes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every click gives you points that can be exchanged for outfits. Play, work, or just type \u2014 every action brings you closer to new costumes. Collect rare outfits, trade them with other players, and create the most fashionable look for your new friend \u2014 Misha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037360/extras/939296bdf4c7670b5fc2ba04e0dcd44b.poster.avif?t=1758916342\" width=480 height=601 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037360/extras/939296bdf4c7670b5fc2ba04e0dcd44b.webm?t=1758916342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo version features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of unique items for customizing Misha has been reduced to 50</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number of unique dance and reaction animations has been reduced to 11</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduced item drop timer</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All listed languages are supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not available in the demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Selling obtained items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interface customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037360?t=1758916342","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037360?t=1758916342","capsule_im